    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "In this room you will find all of the currently included character
        material variations!\n\nThis room only showcases the third person versions
        of these materials, but each of these materials come in a first person version
        as well.\n\nM_ = Stands for \"Material\", this prefix is used for all materials
        in the pack.\n\n_TP_ = Stands for \"Third Person\", this is used for any
        materials meant for the third person character model.\n\nExample:\nM_TP_Camo_001
        = \n(M) Material ,\n(TP) Third Person,\n(Camo_001) The texture variation
        applied to this specific material, in this case the \"Camo 001\" texture."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
