    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The animations in this pack use a specific naming convention to easily
        tell them apart, these are the main ones:\n\nA_ = Stands for \"Animation\",
        this prefix is used for all animations in the pack.\n\n_FP_PCH_ = Stands
        for \"First Person Player Character\", this naming convention is used for
        any files related to the first person character, such as animations and models
        controlled by the player in the first person view.\n\n_TP_CH_ = Stands for
        \"Third Person Character, this convention is used for any files related to
        the third person character.\n\nExample:\nA_FP_PCH_AR_01_Reload_Empty = \n(A)
        Animation ,\n(FP) First Person,\n(AR_01) Weapon type, in this case the AR
        01,\n(Reload_Empty) The action performed by the animation, in this case the
        empty weapon reload."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
