    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'In order to keep animations consistent and speed up workflow we have
        opted to use a few "common/shared" animations between all weapon sets.


        This
        is especially useful for animations that work well across many different
        weapons, such as the walking, running, and idle animations.


        Upper/Lower
        Body Set-Up:


        The third person animations are made to be played
        separately on the lower and upper part of the character. For example the
        weapon specific animations such as reloads could be combined with the movement
        animations such as jogging and sprinting.


        By using this setup we
        don''t have to create multiple animations per weapon set, we can instead
        create a single movement set that is shared between all characters.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
