    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "The materials in this pack use a specific naming convention to easily
        tell them apart, these are the main ones:\n\nM_ = Stands for \"Material\",
        this prefix is used for all materials in the pack.\n\n_FP_ = Stands for \"First
        Person\", this naming convention is used for any materials meant for the
        first person character model.\n\n_TP_ = Stands for \"Third Person\", this
        is used for any materials meant for the third person character model.\n\n_WEP_
        = Stands for \"Weapon\", this is used for any materials used by the weapon
        models.\n\nExample:\nM_WEP_Camo_001 = \n(M) Material ,\n(WEP) Weapon,\n(Camo_001)
        The texture variation applied to this specific material, in this case the
        \"Camo 001\" texture."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
