    - target: {fileID: 4817883505248712873, guid: cdd74a287d6763748a0da1e717364366,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Inside this room you will find all of weapon materials currently included
        with the asset, there are plenty of different variations to find here!\n\nWe
        use specfic naming conventions to easily tell the different materials apart.\n\nM_
        = Stands for \"Material\", this prefix is used for all materials in the pack.\n\n_WEP_
        = Stands for \"Weapon\", this is used for all materials used by the weapon
        models.\n\nExample:\nM_WEP_Skulls_001 = \n(M) Material ,\n(WEP) Weapon,\n(Skulls_001)
        The texture variation applied to this specific material, in this case the
        \"Skulls\" pattern."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
